This licence covers this repository's own work, which includes everything under
`docs/ha-release/` except the copies themselves. Those copies — the files inside each
release folder there — are Home Assistant's release notes and developer-blog posts, kept
so that a documented procedure can be checked. Each one opens with its source URL and the
terms its publisher states: home-assistant.io content is under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, and the
developer documentation repository publishes no licence. Those terms govern those files,
not this one. `docs/ha-release/index.md` lists them and is this repository's own.
